'''Rainwarding''', also known as '''Rain Guard''',{{Ref|m|82|3 (KManga Translation)}} is a [[Spells|spell]] that removes water within a given space.
==Description==
The [[Casting Seal]] contains a reversed [[Signs#Rain|Sign of Rain]] surrounded four evenly-spaced [[Signs#Regions|Signs of Regions]] pointing inwards. The other symbols are currently unknown.

